{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"lowcost-yokelish-jackal","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nThe approved duration analysis on `stalwart-allstar-jaguarundi` measured current operator-visible durations for the two LLM-gated ticket operations. Agent guidance must set explicit wait expectations without including sample-size or long-tail warnings.\n\n## Plan\n- Update the gate-protocol guidance in `AGENTS.md` to state that `review-plan` takes 15 to 20 minutes.\n- State in the same guidance that a completion-verifier-gated close takes 9 to 11 minutes.\n- Keep the wording operational and concise. Do not add methodology, percentile, sample-size, legacy-tail, or uncertainty text.\n- Do not change gate behavior, configuration, or any generated documentation.\n- Submit the documentation-only change through Gerrit and rely on CI for verification.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `AGENTS.md` tells agents to expect 15 to 20 minutes for `review-plan`.\n- [ ] `AGENTS.md` tells agents to expect 9 to 11 minutes for a completion-verifier-gated close.\n- [ ] The maintained guidance contains no warning about sample size, legacy tails, or uncertainty.\n- [ ] No production code, configuration, or other documentation file changes.\n- [ ] Gerrit CI passes the documentation-only change.","id":"6767-cc49-bf6f-4f22","parent_id":"","priority":1,"tags":["docs","agent-guidance","llm-gates"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Document LLM gate duration expectations in agent guidance"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787802692115741001,"uuid":"f88de3f9-b9bb-40c5-97f5-a612fa9e5691"}